      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Branch S — Supabase (phase A)\n\nSEMANTIC GAP, deliberate: branch L DELETES the sheet row, this CANCELS the episode and keeps the history, so a past absence stays explainable (ADR-0015).\n\nIdempotent: cancel_active_ooo_followup returns NULL when nothing is active.\n\nNo Bison call here — branch L needs one to find the lead, this resolves the contact straight from Postgres. A pointless API call would be worse, not more faithful.\n\nonError: continueRegularOutput — must never break branch L.\nRepo: docs/reference/n8n/ooo-phase-a.md",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300
      }
    },
